      "writtenOn": "2025-02-28T05:10:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, didn\u0027t see the last reply from Jiakai. Yes, it sounds a bit complicated to make dex2oat output cdex, or do a full integration test. I\u0027m hoping it\u0027s relatively trivial to construct a test fixture directly in memory, for someone familiar with this code.",
